**Coverage:** partition invariants (Lomuto, Hoare, Dutch national flag) and their swap counts · stable versus in-place rearrangement and what each costs · rearranging by sign, parity or slot; interleaving halves · next and previous permutation with proof; rank and unrank · weak and strict wiggle orders, the median plus virtual-index partition · block-swap rotation, the cost of the three rotation methods, stable partition by rotations, the in-place perfect shuffle.
